msgstr "您将失去评级点数！"

msgid "comp7/deserter/submit"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "comp7/deserter/title"
msgstr "中途离场"

msgid "punishmentWindow/message/ban/comp7"
msgstr ""
"您于{whiteSpanish_Open}%(time)s{whiteSpanish_Close}在{whiteSpanish_Open}%(arenaName)s{whiteSpanish_Close}地图上违反了游戏规则。 \n"
"因此，评级点数{whiteSpanish_Open}%(penalty)s{whiteSpanish_Close}，同时，您已被暂时封禁，无法参加{whiteSpanish_Open}天梯战{whiteSpanish_Close}模式战斗。"

msgid "punishmentWindow/message/ban/comp7/qualification"
msgstr ""
"您于{whiteSpanish_Open}%(time)s{whiteSpanish_Close}在{whiteSpanish_Open}%(arenaName)s{whiteSpanish_Close}地图上违反了游戏规则。\n"
"您已被暂时封禁，无法参加{whiteSpanish_Open}天梯战{whiteSpanish_Close}模式战斗，同时，您的评级已降低。"
